Name:Rules pilot 308 - The Shaman's mana does not wait
Goal:Survive
Turns:1
Difficulty:Hard
Description:It is your first main phase. You control Deathrite Shaman, two Hill Giants, a Swamp and two Wastes. The opponent is at 5 life and controls Sphere of Safety and Glorious Anthem; their graveyard holds a Plains and Lightning Bolt. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:rulesguru-9226825b8528a323 | Sphere of Safety's cost is paid while attackers are declared, when only mana abilities can be activated (CR 508.1g, 605.3a); Deathrite Shaman's targeted mana ability is not one (CR 605.1a), and mana made in the beginning of combat step empties before attackers are declared (CR 500.4): use the Shaman to drain instead
